{{Quote|That was a hard day. I had to make many unpleasant decisions.''"<br />"''Yes, you did. Entire city gone in moments, along with everybody in it. We lost our whole division that day. Man, that was like 5&ndash;10,000 people.|Valin Hess and [[Migs Mayfeld]] reflect on the attack on Burnin Konn|audio=UnpleasantDecisions.flac|<ref name="Chapter 15">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 15: The Believer}}</ref>}}
'''Chakonnis''' was a major [[city]] on the [[Volcano|volcanic]] [[planet]] [[Burnin Konn]]. It was destroyed by a series of volcano eruptions<ref name="Rise" /> in [[4 ABY]]<ref name="Date" /> when [[Imperial Military|forces]] of the [[Galactic Empire]] led by [[General]] [[Valin Hess]] detonated the geothermal reactors within the city and other cities on the world.<ref name="Rise" />

